# Basic requirements
This is a Multi-agent agentic ai project which generates blog posts or multiple types.
This is called a imposter - i'm poster
- Should generate Blog post in Markdown format, with rich formatting.
- should use mcp tools publicly available
- if a tool for purpose is not availble do create one of our own
- always create a sub directory for the blogs and works within them
- document every component in docs directory
- document every task completed as a worklog in worklog directory
- always think, plan and implement, fix
- always update the worklog at the start with proper to be done and keep updating when a todo is done.
- always update the consolidated worklog at the end of each task


# Types of blogs
## Tech Blog:
- creates a sub directory for the blogs and works within them
- creates a blog post with a friendly, subtle funny, conversational tone.
- sprayed with example snippets with inline comments
- creates a code directory with proper structure and install scripts and readme
- Structure of the blog as follows:
    - Goal - bullet points of the goals we want to acheive in this blog post
    - Approach - the approach which we will take to acheive the goal
    - Topic breakup - break up the approach into topics which will be covered
    - Topic - good explanation of the topic and details
    - wrapup - consolidate the blog post in bulltet points
    - references - reference used and further reading recommendations - urls and a short description
    - conclusion and next steps 
